\
# Technology Stack\
\
## Overview\
\
The BitePlate Smart Restaurant Management System is designed as a Modular Monolith backend application using modern Java technologies and event-driven communication.\
\
The technology stack was selected to balance maintainability, scalability, and enterprise software engineering practices.\
\
